    <li><code>.eyebrow</code> labels provide uppercase section markers; keep them short and avoid sentence case.</li>
    <li><code>.lede</code> text should stay near 1.05rem and use muted color to establish hierarchy without overwhelming the headline.</li>
    <li>When listing metadata, use the <code>.meta</code>, <code>.meta-pill</code>, and <code>.muted</code> helpers to keep spacing and color consistent.</li>
  </ul>
